Fitted tables in src/consts.rs
  - KEY_WEIGHTS and KEY_BIAS (the learned key model) were fitted on the GiantSteps Key dataset and the
    Beatport EDM Key dataset (Zenodo record 1101082), both under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
    (CC BY-SA 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). Treat these weights as derived from that
    data: credit the datasets and share changes to the weights alike.
  - BPM_KNOTS and KEY_KNOTS (the "likely right" tables) were fitted on GiantSteps and Beatport tempo and key
    results and on HJDB from the Beat This! release (Zenodo record 13922116, CC BY 4.0): credit the datasets.
  Keep this notice with any copy of the engine you distribute.

Third-party crates
  symphonia (optional "decode" feature, on by default): MPL-2.0.
  rustfft: MIT OR Apache-2.0. libm: MIT OR Apache-2.0. miniz_oxide: MIT OR Zlib OR Apache-2.0.

Not included
  The optional ADTOF drum model Tastr's server can use (CC BY-NC-SA) is not part of this crate; the engine
  only accepts its hits as input.
